        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-305 (ensure controlled execution — Enterprise Risk Management (PA-21.2).) | - operational: Head of Internal Audit review and approval gate
Owner: Head of Internal Audit</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
